[0.037, "o", "\r\n── make-expert-app Clack env (no session cookie)\r\n   GET /healthz status: 200\r\n   GET /readyz status: 200\r\n   GET / status: 302\r\n   GET / Location: \"/login\"\r\n   look at: /healthz and /readyz stay unauthenticated (C4). GET / is a 302 to /login.\r\n\r\n── Corporate-boot done. Reviewer: kind/tenant scoped; probes 200; / challenges.\r\n"]
